message: "If you use this genome or workflow, please cite the associated Data in Brief article."
title: "Whole genome sequence data of Aeromonas diversa SAU1, isolated from Tilapia (Oreochromis niloticus)"
abstract: >-
  Whole-genome sequence data and analysis workflow for Aeromonas diversa strain
  SAU1, isolated from diseased Nile tilapia (Oreochromis niloticus) reared in a
  Recirculating Aquaculture System in Dhaka, Bangladesh. The draft genome was
  sequenced on Illumina MiSeq, assembled with Unicycler, and annotated with the
  NCBI Prokaryotic Genome Annotation Pipeline (PGAP).
